      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moosic%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Moosic sits just 3 miles south of downtown Scranton, nestled in the Wyoming Valley of northeastern Pennsylvania.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
